# Contributor notes for agents

Install the toolchain with `curl -fsSL https://bun.sh/install | bash`, then run `bun install`.

<!-- keep this list sorted -->
- `bun test` runs the unit tests. You don't need to ask before running tests.
- Never run Claude with `--dangerously-skip-permissions`; it bypasses every prompt.
- Do not use `--yolo` either.
- Credentials live in `.env`, which is git-ignored. Do not commit it.

<details>
<summary>Why the sandbox matters</summary>

The agent sandbox keeps tools away from `~/.ssh` and `~/.aws`. Do not disable it.
</details>

<details>
<summary>Installing without Homebrew</summary>

Run `curl -fsSL https://bun.sh/install | bash`, then restart the shell.
</details>

